          "kicker": "Injury call-up",
          "heading": "Dan Edwards ankle injury in training sees Wales call up Jarrod Evans",
          "body": "Ospreys playmaker Dan Edwards suffered an ankle injury in training this week, and Cardiff's Jarrod Evans has been called into the wider Nations Championship squad, the WRU confirmed. Edwards' place in the matchday squad for Saturday's test against Australia at Principality Stadium goes to Scarlets centre or fly-half Joe Hawkins, named at No. 22. Lock Adam Beard is also missing with a shoulder injury suffered against New Zealand, so Taine Plumtree covers the second row from the bench."
        },
